        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for ghostscript fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-39919: heap-based buffer overflow in the JPEG 2000 output adapter allows attackers to cause memory corruption\n  by supplying crafted PDFs (bsc#1280620).\n\nChanges for ghostscript:\n\n- Version upgrade to 10.08.0\n",
